---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import FlowDiagram from "../components/FlowDiagram.astro";
import ExperienceJourney from "../components/ExperienceJourney.astro";
---
<Layout title="Ken Lim — Data & AI, end to end" description="Ken Lim builds the end-to-end data-to-AI stack — ingestion pipelines, governed data platforms, trained and tuned models, to shipped data and AI products. 18+ years across fintech, healthtech, proptech and the public sector.">

  <!-- letterhead / hero -->
  <section class="pt-14 pb-12 text-center sm:pt-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-[#03aa5c] dark:text-[#3cc287]">Data &amp; AI · End to End</p>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">
      I build the <span class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">end-to-end data-to-AI stack</span> — ingestion
      pipelines, governed data platforms, trained and tuned models, and AI services — from raw data to shipped product.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500">
      18+ years · fintech · healthtech · proptech · public sector · U.S. citizen
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 font-mono text-[12px]">
      <a class="text-[#03aa5c] hover:underline dark:text-[#3cc287]" href="mailto:mail@kennylim.com">mail@kennylim.com</a>
      <a class="text-stone-500 hover:text-[#03aa5c] dark:text-stone-400 dark:hover:text-stone-100" href="tel:+19298889061">+1 (929) 888-9061</a>
      <a class="text-stone-500 hover:text-[#03aa5c] dark:text-stone-400 dark:hover:text-stone-100" href="https://linkedin.com/in/kenny-lim" rel="noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 1. about me -->
  <section class="border-t border-stone-200/80 py-12 dark:border-stone-800">
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">About me</h2>
    <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">
      <p>
        Most AI initiatives don't fail at the model — they fail at the data. The trouble hides
        between the layers. I work the full stack: ingesting raw data, pipelines and
        transformation, governed platforms, the ML layer, and the AI services on top — agents,
        RAG, MCP. Being hands-on in every layer is what lets me catch the gaps between them.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm a hands-on data tech lead, which keeps me on the front line and in touch with
        reality: I set strategy, design the architecture, write
        production code, and grow the people around me — coaching in-house teams and leading
        onshore and offshore contractors.         I do the elbow-greasing work too: complex, messy data
        doesn't become clean, governed tables without tenacity and grit.         And I run what I build day to day — monitoring, scaling, tuning — so I see firsthand
        how it behaves in production.
      </p>
      <p>
        It's been an 18+ year run — fintech, healthtech, consumer and enterprise SaaS, proptech
        and the public sector, with three companies acquired along the way. It started with a
        decade of consulting, delivering big-data builds on modern stacks for clients in
        finance, government, health, retail and utilities around the world. That work made me
        pragmatic, results-driven, cost-conscious and transparent — and taught me that success
        is the client running the platform, using it every day, and
        achieving the objective it was built for — long after the consultant leaves.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. what I do -->
  <section id="do" class="scroll-mt-6 border-t border-stone-200/80 py-12 dark:border-stone-800">
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">What I do</h2>
    <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">
      <p>
        The five stages below — what each one produces.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-9">
      <FlowDiagram />
    </div>
    <p class="mt-8 font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">
      Where I've done it → <a class="text-[#03aa5c] hover:underline dark:text-[#3cc287]" href="/experience">Experience</a>
    </p>
  </section>

</Layout>
